{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36201","headline":"茅山赠洪拾遗 · 方干","name":"茅山赠洪拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代谏臣停谏舌，求归故里傲云霞。\n溪头讲树缆渔艇，箧里朝衣输酒家。\n但爱身闲辞禄俸，那嫌岁计在桑麻。\n我来幸与诸生异，问答时容近绦纱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}